From 7187029c2c8148210b1d43a4ebdc8eea366d8b6d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ivan Faeton Danishevskyi <faeton@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 10:38:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Reboot credential: harden storage, lifecycle and dispatch

Unreadable records only disable their own action, stale reboots are dropped after a
successful verification of the same user, the credential is deleted when the owner removes
the lock or picks an equal one, reboot escrow is cleared before the reboot, and every
credential argument is zeroized on all paths.
